          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Mara respects Ivo's distance, and the windless launch turns naturally into shared drawing; the second stool makes a warm concrete ending.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The sparrow moment adds gentle observation, while the failed flight still leads credibly to Ivo joining Mara at the drawing table.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Mara adapts to Ivo's wish for privacy, but strong gusts prevent flying; their shared design gives the disappointment a satisfying resolution.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"Clear, polished scenes show Mara being quieter for Ivo; despite the wind stopping the launch, his drawing beside her provides a complete ending.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":9,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":9,\"overall\":9},\"note\":\"Mara's quieter invitation lets Ivo take the reel, and the successful kite flight visibly confirms their growing trust as they walk to his gate.\" ,\"group_id\":1},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"A repaired line, Mara's restraint, and Ivo's gradual closeness are clearly handled; the unused kite leads meaningfully to collaborative drawing.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The story gently develops Ivo's comfort through Mara's low-key invitation, then resolves the windless disappointment with a shared picture.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The bird interlude is pleasant but not essential; the central arc remains clear: a considerate invitation, an unflyable kite, and companionship through drawing.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The mended loop is a coherent preparation detail, and the quiet failed outing ends with Ivo physically moving closer to make art with Mara.\" ,\"group_id\":0},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":8,\"style\":8,\"grammar\":9,\"storytelling\":8,\"overall\":8},\"note\":\"The frayed line is repaired after the outing, though it does not cause the failed launch; the emotional resolution remains the children's shared drawing.\" ,\"group_id\":0}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":1,\"causal_path\":2,\"ending\":2,\"language\":2,\"overall\":2},\"diversity_evidence\":\"This sample is overwhelmingly one plot: Mara tries a gentler approach with shy Ivo, kite flying fails, and they make art together (s000029, s000057, s000047, s000073, s000043, s000068, s000096, s000005, s000085). Only s000034 materially changes the outcome by having Ivo fly the kite successfully; sparrows, line condition, invitation wording, and wind type are minor variations.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"group_id\":0,\"summary\":\"Mara approaches shy Ivo more gently; the kite cannot be flown, so their growing connection is resolved through making a drawing together.\"},{\"group_id\":1,\"summary\":\"Mara approaches Ivo gently; he takes part in flying the kite successfully, and they leave together in an established friendship.\"}]}"
        }
